":"Two new public computers"},{"id":"reminders","label":"App-based reminder service"}]},"explanation_prompt":"Which residents does your plan serve best, and who might it still miss?"}'::jsonb, '{"author":"Reasoning Lab project team","created":"2026-10-16","license":"MIT","origin":"original","fictional_data":true,"contamination_note":"Original fictional data; not published before 2026-10-16."}'::jsonb, 'a9f09406a2c76cc339265ae3e4ff69ac7b7edbe77e17b6abadd6b006e589eac7') on conflict (id) do nothing;
